    "detailed_description": "\ud83c\udfa9\ud83c\udf7b In <strong>Beer n Pee Dreams VR</strong>, you're the &quot;beer-o&quot; of your own story\u2014where hops meet both hopes and, well, the need to pee. Hop in, sip up, and get ready to a dream world that's as wacky as it is wet!  \ud83c\udfb6\ud83c\udf19<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strap in for a pee-rific adventure:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \ud83c\udf0c\ud83d\udebd Get lost in the dreams as you search for the relief station\u2014a.k.a. the bathroom.<br></li><li> \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f\ud83c\udfb8 Light up the night with <strong>lanterns</strong> in your virtual hands.<br></li><li> \ud83c\udfb6\ud83c\udf19 Leap through a <strong>moonlit</strong> scene so vibey, it's like <strong>Clair de Lune</strong> came to life.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfb5\ud83c\udf7a And yes, you'll actually hear Clair de Lune and Gymnop\u00e9dies as you make that &quot;one small <strong>leap</strong> for man, but a <strong>giant sip</strong> for mankind.&quot;<br></li><li> \ud83c\udfa9\ud83c\udfb6And to wrap it all up, our <strong>original main theme</strong> wears many hats\u2014from rock'n roll rhythms to funky beats</li></ul><br>Dive in and get ready to blur the lines between dreams and reality in the most epic, beer-fueled way possible! \ud83c\udfb5\ud83c\udf7b",
    "about_the_game": "\ud83c\udfa9\ud83c\udf7b In <strong>Beer n Pee Dreams VR</strong>, you're the &quot;beer-o&quot; of your own story\u2014where hops meet both hopes and, well, the need to pee. Hop in, sip up, and get ready to a dream world that's as wacky as it is wet!  \ud83c\udfb6\ud83c\udf19<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strap in for a pee-rific adventure:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \ud83c\udf0c\ud83d\udebd Get lost in the dreams as you search for the relief station\u2014a.k.a. the bathroom.<br></li><li> \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f\ud83c\udfb8 Light up the night with <strong>lanterns</strong> in your virtual hands.<br></li><li> \ud83c\udfb6\ud83c\udf19 Leap through a <strong>moonlit</strong> scene so vibey, it's like <strong>Clair de Lune</strong> came to life.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfb5\ud83c\udf7a And yes, you'll actually hear Clair de Lune and Gymnop\u00e9dies as you make that &quot;one small <strong>leap</strong> for man, but a <strong>giant sip</strong> for mankind.&quot;<br></li><li> \ud83c\udfa9\ud83c\udfb6And to wrap it all up, our <strong>original main theme</strong> wears many hats\u2014from rock'n roll rhythms to funky beats</li></ul><br>Dive in and get ready to blur the lines between dreams and reality in the most epic, beer-fueled way possible! \ud83c\udfb5\ud83c\udf7b",
    "short_description": "Strap in for a pee-rific short adventure! In Beer n Pee Dreams VR, platforms surround you in 360 degrees while you're on a mad dash to the bathroom. Score beers and dodge barrels, all to the beat of rock, funk, and the classic Clair de Lune. All this with light-hearted humor.",
